\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4c1a886a-7db5-4e00-bbc6-d4243534f057</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4c1a886a-7db5-4e00-bbc6-d4243534f057\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4c1a886a-7db5-4e00-bbc6-d4243534f057\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_Scroll_Knock</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Scroll_Knock+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Scroll_Knock+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlocks an object that is held shut by a mundane lock.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the back room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mason%27s_Guild_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mason's Guild Basement\">Mason's Guild Basement</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;134&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-738</span>, accessible by spotting the button to it with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skittle\" title=\"Skittle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/25px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/38px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/50px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Skittle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png/25px-Portrait_Skittle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Portrait_Skittle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Skittle\" title=\"Skittle\">Skittle</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2019/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31618/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7095/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1216000/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.155      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   55.155      1 -total\n 49.50%   27.302      9 Template:Icon_text\n 44.04%   24.293     23 Template:Trim\n 20.33%   11.213      3 Template:Uid\n 11.49%    6.338      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.04%    6.087      3 Template:Template_style\n 10.85%    5.983      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.73%    5.920      2 Temp